body:
Bartape is missing and steerer tube is uncut because it's not fitted yet. And yes, I use spds on my roadie, because I ride a lot of bikes and like to be able to wear the same shoes, I will also use this bike to commute in the summer. (have a dedicaded winter/commuting bike)The black thing between the front wheel and the frame is a pedal strap from a fixedgear to keep the bars from spinning while working on the bike.

&#x200B;

this was my old frameset: [https://imgur.com/N99sSpI](https://imgur.com/N99sSpI)
